1
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:10,740
ありがとう
Thank you, she says

2
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:15,140
もう一度言うよ
and then she says it once more

3
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:19,540
聞こえるまで
until it is heard

4
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:00,600
ありがとう
Thank you, she says

5
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:05,000
もう一度言うよ
and then she says it once more

6
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:09,400
聞こえるまで
until it is heard
